blavaan 0.2-3 has been released; see here <http://faculty.missouri.edu/~merklee/blavaan/version.html> for more detail.

lavaan 0.5-23.1097 was coincidentally released on the same day, causing a bug in blavaan's coef() function. Until a fix is made, the workaround is

coef(as(fit, "lavaan"))

where fit is an object of class blavaan.

Ed

